{"quest_id": 8430, "name": "訓練場の雪合戦", "description": "雪の積もった訓練場にやってきた王子たち。\n北部での戦いに備える模擬戦という口実で、\n砲術を使った激しい雪合戦が始まる……！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "ゴールドラッシュ33(2024)", "event_category": "Reproduce", "mission_id": 300481, "map_no": 4972, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "exp": 300, "gold": 800, "drops": [{"item": 1002, "c": 1}, {"card": 58, "c": 1}, {"item": 1007, "c": 1}, {"item": 10037}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 15000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 15000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_range": 250, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 120, "attack_interval": 313, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2101344, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 514, "missile": {"speed": 10.0}, "master_id": 33025, "global_id": 6642, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 8000, "attack": 450, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 450, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 300, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 120, "attack_interval": 343, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2101360, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 514, "missile": {"speed": 10.0}, "master_id": 38194, "global_id": 11811, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 131, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097488, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 25, "global_id": 24, "spawn_sec": 11}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 172, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097504, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 26, "global_id": 25, "spawn_sec": 32}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 11000, "attack": 650, "base_hp": 11000, "base_attack": 650, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_range": 320, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 120, "attack_interval": 313, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2109472, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 514, "missile": {"speed": 10.0}, "master_id": 38197, "global_id": 11814, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 48}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 22, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 70, "attack_range": 280, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 120, "attack_interval": 313, "move_speed": 750.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2101392, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 514, "missile": {"speed": 10.0}, "master_id": 33024, "global_id": 6641, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 57}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 13000, "attack": 700, "base_hp": 13000, "base_attack": 700, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "attack_range": 320, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 120, "attack_interval": 313, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2144720, "race_id": 19, "special_effect_id": 1390, "missile_id": 514, "missile": {"speed": 10.0}, "master_id": 38196, "global_id": 11813, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 79}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 9000, "attack": 550, "base_hp": 9000, "base_attack": 550, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_range": 340, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 120, "attack_interval": 313, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2145616, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 222, "missile_id": 514, "missile": {"speed": 10.0}, "master_id": 38195, "global_id": 11812, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 140}, {"enemy_id": 9, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 10500, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 10500, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 120, "attack_range": 300, "attack_speed": 75, "attack_wait": 75, "attack_interval": 199, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2111280, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 235, "missile_id": 514, "missile": {"speed": 10.0}, "master_id": 38198, "global_id": 11815, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 140}], "popups": ["ハリンヘイムが味方ユニットの\n射程範囲内にいる場合、\n遠距離攻撃を自身に引き付けます。\n\nスキルやアビリティなどで\n攻撃の優先順位が指定された\n敵がいる場合や一部の攻撃は\n引き付けの効果を受けません。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "メル", "text": "来るべき北方での戦いに備えて！", "face": "u199"}, {"name": "スミレ", "text": "いざ尋常に雪合戦だァ――ッ！！", "face": "u1000a1"}, {"name": "パーシス", "text": "訓練と聞いていたのだが……。\nこれはいったいどういうことだ？", "face": "u192"}, {"name": "イブキ", "text": "訓練というのは嘘じゃないさ。\nほら、現在北方で「黒い光冠」だのと、\n色々騒ぎになっているだろう？", "face": "u511"}, {"name": "フレデリカ", "text": "……だから雪の積もった訓練場で模擬戦を？", "face": "u362"}, {"name": "カノン", "text": "なるほど、今後予想される北部での戦いに備えて、\nここで訓練しておく、ってことね。", "face": "u264"}, {"name": "ハリンヘイム", "text": "でも、皆さん遊ぶつもりというか、\n完全に雪合戦をする気に見えますが……。", "face": "u1854a1"}, {"name": "イブキ", "text": "訓練というのは嘘じゃないが、\n名目上の話だからね。", "face": "u511"}, {"name": "スミレ", "text": "こんなに雪が積もってんだからよ、\nみんなで雪合戦と洒落込みたくてなァ！", "face": "u1000a1"}, {"name": "メル", "text": "さぁ、大砲を構えなさい！\n砲手の中で誰が一番雪玉を扱うのが上手いか、\nここで決めましょう！", "face": "u199"}, {"name": "パーシス", "text": "ほう、大砲を使った雪合戦か。\n中々どうして、面白そうだ。", "face": "u192"}, {"name": "フレデリカ", "text": "砲術で競うというのなら、\n俄然、やる気が湧いてきました。", "face": "u362"}, {"name": "ハリンヘイム", "text": "そういうことなら、\n号砲の亜神が参戦しないわけにはいきません。", "face": "u1854a1"}, {"name": "ハリンヘイム", "text": "戦士のひとりとして、\n全力で雪玉をぶつけてあげましょう！", "face": "u1854a1"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "イブキ", "text": "――そこまで！\n皆、一旦止めて休憩にしよう。", "face": "u511"}, {"name": "メル", "text": "ふぅ、白熱の雪合戦だったわね。", "face": "u199"}, {"name": "パーシス", "text": "あれだけ撃ち合えばな。\nメルの言うように、\n雪合戦とは思えないほどの激戦だった。", "face": "u192"}, {"name": "スミレ", "text": "いやァ、楽しい訓練だった！\nみんなの腕前も見れて大満足だなァ！", "face": "u1000a1"}, {"name": "スミレ", "text": "よぅし！　少し休んだら、\nまた雪玉を撃ち合おうじゃねェか！", "face": "u1000a1"}, {"name": "ハリンヘイム", "text": "みんな元気ですね。\nこうして一緒に訓練をすると、\n王国の戦士は心強い者たちばかりだと実感します。", "face": "u1854a1"}, {"name": "メル", "text": "ふふん、もちろんよ！\nあたしたちはまだまだ強くなるんだから！", "face": "u199"}, {"name": "フレデリカ", "text": "ええ、みんなで成長しましょう。\n北方の異変や「黒い光冠」の件にも、\nちゃんと立ち向かえるように。", "face": "u362"}, {"name": "メル", "text": "それじゃ、もっと訓練が必要ね。\nみんな、休憩は十分かしら。", "face": "u199"}, {"name": "スミレ", "text": "聞くまでもねェさ！\n雪合戦の第二回戦をはじめようぜ！", "face": "u1000a1"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map4972", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 22, "y": 334}, {"k": "m", "x": 98, "y": 404, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 181, "y": 404, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 101, "y": 253, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 256, "y": 400, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 786, "y": 414, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 709, "y": 388, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 863, "y": 255, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 181, "y": 325, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 258, "y": 255, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 283, "y": 325, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 363, "y": 326, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 432, "y": 295, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 526, "y": 292, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 591, "y":